  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「うわぁ……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「最後の乗り物に観覧車を選んで、正解だったかもね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ゆっくり上昇して、下降して〜って感じだから、わたしでも耐えられるし。景色がとってもきれい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「　視界がどんどん広がってくね〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「広いなぁ、遊園地。一日じゃあ、ぜんぶ廻りきるのは無理だね。また、いっしょにこようね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「うわぁ、きらきら輝いてるよ。ちょうどパレードの時間なんだね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「まだまだ大盛況だよ、ライブも盛りあがってたもんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「光るスティックとか帽子とかがキラキラしてて、地上にもうひとつ星空ができたみたいだね〜。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「こよちゃんにも、見せてあげたかったな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「あはは。何か最初と最後だけ、良いとこどりでごめんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「桐島さんたちと、羽森さんにお勉強を教えてたりしたらもうこんな時間なんだもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「転校生くんと、あんまり一緒にいられなかったね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたしも転校生くんも、下級生のお守りをしたりしてさ、学校と変わらないね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「遊園地って非日常のはずなんだけどなぁ。でもまぁ、これはこれで幸せな感じかも♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「みんな、キラキラ笑顔で終われたしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「最後に、こうして転校生くんとものんびりできてるし。あぁ、充実した一日だったよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「転校生くんも、楽しんでくれたならいいな……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「コホ、コホ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「さすがに、疲れちゃったよ。ちょっとだけ、寄りかかってもいいかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「まだ、けっこうグッタリしてるよ。ずいぶん、休んだんだけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「やっぱり、わたしが遊園地なんか無謀だったかなぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「いつも、支えてくれてありがとうね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「転校生くんと、知りあえて、仲良くなれてよかった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「寄りかかれるひとがいるって、いいね。でもいつも、苦労ばっかりかけちゃってるなぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「今日は、すこしでも恩返しがしたかったんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「けっきょく、心配かけてばっかりでさ。なかなか、難しいね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「あっ、しずくちゃんが見えるよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「よかった、軽音部のひとたちと合流できたんだね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
